OL,3,GNEWSACar ram murder accused 'wanted to
OL,4,Ascare' victim
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man accused of murderously ramming a
OL,7,Fman on a petrol forecourt as part of a
OL,8,Ffamily feud has told jurors he only
OL,9,Fwanted to "scare" the victim away.
OL,11,FDaniel Ambler, 23, was declared dead at
OL,12,Fthe scene after Ashton Anderson's
OL,13,FNissan X-Trail impaled him on a metal
OL,14,Fshelf in Seaham, County Durham, in
OL,15,FJanuary, Teesside Crown Court heard.
OL,17,FBarry Anderson, 52, and his sons
OL,18,FAshton, 20, and Logan, 19, deny murder.
OL,19,FTwo 18-year-olds, Tyler Leadbetter and
OL,20,FAjay Henry, deny the same charge.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
