OL,3,GNEWSACar ram murder accused 'wanted to
OL,4,Ascare' victim
OL,5,
OL,6,FBarry Anderson declined to give
OL,7,Fevidence, while Ashton Anderson told
OL,8,Fjurors there had been multiple
OL,9,Fincidents between his family and the
OL,10,Fvictim's but he felt "terrible" about
OL,11,Fthe killing and offered to admit
OL,12,Fmanslaughter.
